OL,3,GNEWSADate set for Halloween party
OL,4,Astabbing trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo boys could stand trial over the
OL,7,Fstabbing of five teenagers who were
OL,8,Fattacked at a Halloween party.
OL,10,FPolice were called to a house in Park
OL,11,FRoad, Chandler's Ford, Hampshire,
OL,12,Fshortly after 22:30 GMT on 31 October,
OL,13,Fafter an "unknown group" got into the
OL,14,Fparty over a garden fence.
OL,16,FTwo 16-year-old boys from Southampton
OL,17,Fappeared at Southampton Crown Court,
OL,18,Fone charged with attempted murder and
OL,19,Fthe other with wounding with intent.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
